fail-closed-redirector

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Keep the macOS transparent proxy running when mitmdump detaches and refuse matching flows until it reattaches, so an intercepted process never reaches the network directly while its proxy restarts.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream mitmproxy redirector fails closed for in-scope flows when no controller is attached.
